### 2. `/bg` Skill — new file
**Path:** `~/.claude/skills/bg/SKILL.md`

Invokable via `/bg <task>` or triggered when input starts with `[bg]`.

Behavior:
- Strip the `/bg` or `[bg]` prefix
- Spawn `Agent({ description: "<3-word task>", prompt: "<task>", run_in_background: true })`
- Confirm spawn in one line: `→ BG: <3-word task>`
- Return to main thread immediately

