### 4. Modify `pre-tool-use.js` — ~35 lines added
**Path:** `~/.claude/hooks/pre-tool-use.js`

At the top of the compaction check block, read `session-state.json` for `tokenmaxxing` flag. When true:

- **Lower thresholds:** tier 2 fires at 60% (down from 65%), tier 4 critical at 82% (down from 88%)
- **Auto-compact at tier 2:** instead of printing a suggestion, emit the `/compact` hint directly as a `blockOutput` so Claude receives it as a system instruction to compact now
- **Heavy-tool delegation:** if context >58% AND tool is `Agent`, `WebSearch`, or `WebFetch`, inject a one-line note: `⚡ tokenmaxxing: offload to @deepseek/@qwen first`
- **Token economy warnings:** lower budget thresholds by ~20% (warn at 64k, critical at 120k)

